item.description:
&lt;p style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Noto Sans KR&#39;, 맑은고딕, &#39;malgun gothic&#39;, AppleGothic, 돋움, dotum, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;□ 2026년 9월중 예금은행의 신규취급액 기준 저축성수신금리는 연 3.45%로 전월대비&amp;nbsp;0.24%p 상승하였으며, 대출금리는 연 4.57%로 전월대비 0.17%p 상승&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Noto Sans KR&#39;, 맑은고딕, &#39;malgun gothic&#39;, AppleGothic, 돋움, dotum, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Noto Sans KR&#39;, 맑은고딕, &#39;malgun gothic&#39;, AppleGothic, 돋움, dotum, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;― 2026년 9월말 잔액 기준 총수신금리는 연 2.27%로 전월말대비 0.07%p 상승하였으며, 총대출금리는 연 4.48%로 전월말대비 0.08%p 상승&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Noto Sans KR&#39;, 맑은고딕, &#39;malgun gothic&#39;, AppleGothic, 돋움, dotum, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Noto Sans KR&#39;, 맑은고딕, &#39;malgun gothic&#39;, AppleGothic, 돋움, dotum, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;□ 자세한 내용은 &amp;lt;붙임&amp;gt; 참조&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;□ 2026년 10월 기업심리지수는 제조업이 전월대비 6.1p 상승한 105.6을, 비제조업은 전월대비 4.3p 상승한 103.2를 기록&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;□ 2026년 10월 경제심리지수(ESI)는 전월에 비해 0.9p 상승한 100.8을 기록&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;※ 자세한 내용은 &amp;lt;첨부파일&amp;gt;을 참조하시기 바랍니다.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Noto Sans KR&#39;, 맑은고딕, &#39;malgun gothic&#39;, AppleGothic, 돋움, dotum, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;◈ 실질 국내총생산(GDP)은 전기대비 1.0% 성장,&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Noto Sans KR&#39;, 맑은고딕, &#39;malgun gothic&#39;, AppleGothic, 돋움, dotum, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Noto Sans KR&#39;, 맑은고딕, &#39;malgun gothic&#39;, AppleGothic, 돋움, dotum, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; 전년동기대비 3.4% 성장&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Noto Sans KR&#39;, 맑은고딕, &#39;malgun gothic&#39;, AppleGothic, 돋움, dotum, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Noto Sans KR&#39;, 맑은고딕, &#39;malgun gothic&#39;, AppleGothic, 돋움, dotum, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Noto Sans KR&#39;, 맑은고딕, &#39;malgun gothic&#39;, AppleGothic, 돋움, dotum, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Noto Sans KR&#39;, 맑은고딕, &#39;malgun gothic&#39;, AppleGothic, 돋움, dotum, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;◈ 실질 국내총소득(GDI)은 전기대비 3.4% 증가,&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Noto Sans KR&#39;, 맑은고딕, &#39;malgun gothic&#39;, AppleGothic, 돋움, dotum, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Noto Sans KR&#39;, 맑은고딕, &#39;malgun gothic&#39;, AppleGothic, 돋움, dotum, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; 전년동기대비 18.8% 증가&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Noto Sans KR&#39;, 맑은고딕, &#39;malgun gothic&#39;, AppleGothic, 돋움, dotum, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Noto Sans KR&#39;, 맑은고딕, &#39;malgun gothic&#39;, AppleGothic, 돋움, dotum, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Noto Sans KR&#39;, 맑은고딕, &#39;malgun gothic&#39;, AppleGothic, 돋움, dotum, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Noto Sans KR&#39;, 맑은고딕, &#39;malgun gothic&#39;, AppleGothic, 돋움, dotum, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;※ 자세한 내용은 첨부파일 참고&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Noto Sans KR&#39;, 맑은고딕, &#39;malgun gothic&#39;, AppleGothic, 돋움, dotum, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;소비자들&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;의 경제상황에 대한 심리를 종합적으로 나타내는 소비자심리지수(CCSI)는&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 맑은고딕, &#39;malgun gothic&#39;, AppleGothic, 돋움, dotum, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt; font-family: 돋움;&quot;&gt;10월 중 105.4&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt; font-family: 돋움;&quot;&gt;로 전월 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt; font-family: 돋움;&quot;&gt;대비 1.2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt; font-family: 돋움;&quot;&gt;p 하락&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 맑은고딕, &#39;malgun gothic&#39;, AppleGothic, 돋움, dotum, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt; font-family: 돋움;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Noto Sans KR&#39;, 맑은고딕, &#39;malgun gothic&#39;, AppleGothic, 돋움, dotum, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;* 자세한 내용은 첨부파일을 참조해주시기 바랍니다.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;※&amp;nbsp; 우리나라 비금융 영리법인기업 전체를 대상으로 작성한 통계로, 지난 6월 10일 공표한 ｢2025년 기업경영분석 결과(속보)｣&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; (외감법 적용 34,456개 기업)와는 조사대상에 차이가 있음&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;□&amp;nbsp; ｢2025년 기업경영분석｣ 주요 내용 : &amp;lsquo;붙임&amp;rsquo; 참조&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;□ ｢2025년 기업경영분석｣ 부문별 세부 통계 : 한국은행 홈페이지 및 한국은행 경제통계시스템(ECOS) 참조&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;mdash; 기업경영분석 해설을 포함한 ｢2025년 기업경영분석｣ 책자는 12월중 발간 예정&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Noto Sans KR&#39;, 맑은고딕, &#39;malgun gothic&#39;, AppleGothic, 돋움, dotum, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;□ M2(광의통화, 계절조정계열, 평잔)는 전월대비 0.9% 증가&amp;nbsp; [원계열, 전년동월대비 +5.6%]&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Noto Sans KR&#39;, 맑은고딕, &#39;malgun gothic&#39;, AppleGothic, 돋움, dotum, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Noto Sans KR&#39;, 맑은고딕, &#39;malgun gothic&#39;, AppleGothic, 돋움, dotum, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;□ 자세한 내용은 &amp;lt;붙임&amp;gt; 참조&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Noto Sans KR&#39;, 맑은고딕, &#39;malgun gothic&#39;, AppleGothic, 돋움, dotum, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;letter-spacing: -0.27px; color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;□ 2026년 8&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;letter-spacing: -0.27px; color: rgb(77, 77, 77);&quot;&gt;월 경상수지는 461.1억달러 흑자를 기록&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 12px; line-height: 20.8px; letter-spacing: -0.27px; font-family: &#39;Noto Sans KR&#39;, 맑은고딕, &#39;malgun gothic&#39;, AppleGothic, 돋움, dotum, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; color: rgb(77, 77, 77); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 12px; line-height: 20.8px; letter-spacing: -0.27px; font-family: &#39;Noto Sans KR&#39;, 맑은고딕, &#39;malgun gothic&#39;, AppleGothic, 돋움, dotum, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; color: rgb(77, 77, 77); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;□ 자세한 내용은 (붙임) 참조&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;- 2026년 2/4분기중 우리나라 경제활동의 결과 발생한 국내부문의 순자금운용 규모는 147.8조원을 기록&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;- 자세한 내용은 보도자료를 참고하시기 바랍니다.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Noto Sans KR&#39;, 맑은고딕, &#39;malgun gothic&#39;, AppleGothic, 돋움, dotum, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;□ 2026년 8월중 예금은행의 신규취급액 기준 저축성수신금리는 연 3.21%로 전월 수준을 유지하였으며, 대출금리는 연 4.40%로 전월대비 0.13%p 상승&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Noto Sans KR&#39;, 맑은고딕, &#39;malgun gothic&#39;, AppleGothic, 돋움, dotum, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Noto Sans KR&#39;, 맑은고딕, &#39;malgun gothic&#39;, AppleGothic, 돋움, dotum, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;― 2026년 8월말 잔액 기준 총수신금리는 연 2.20%로 전월말대비 0.05%p 상승하였으며, 총대출금리는 연 4.40%로 전월말대비 0.03%p 상승&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Noto Sans KR&#39;, 맑은고딕, &#39;malgun gothic&#39;, AppleGothic, 돋움, dotum, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Noto Sans KR&#39;, 맑은고딕, &#39;malgun gothic&#39;, AppleGothic, 돋움, dotum, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;□ 자세한 내용은 &amp;lt;붙임&amp;gt; 참조&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;□ 2026년 9월 기업심리지수는 제조업이 전월대비 4.3p 하락한 99.5를, 비제조업은 전월대비 2.2p 상승한 98.9를&amp;nbsp;기록&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;□ 2026년 9월 경제심리지수(ESI)는 전월에 비해 0.5p 상승한 99.9를 기록&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;※ 자세한 내용은 &amp;lt;첨부파일&amp;gt;을 참조하시기 바랍니다.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;소비자들&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;의 경제상황에 대한 심리를 종합적으로 나타내는 소비자심리지수(CCSI)는&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 맑은고딕, &#39;malgun gothic&#39;, AppleGothic, 돋움, dotum, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt; font-family: 돋움;&quot;&gt;9월 중 106.6으&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt; font-family: 돋움;&quot;&gt;로 전월&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt; font-family: 돋움;&quot;&gt;대비 2.1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt; font-family: 돋움;&quot;&gt;p 상승&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 맑은고딕, &#39;malgun gothic&#39;, AppleGothic, 돋움, dotum, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt; font-family: 돋움;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;* 자세한 내용은 첨부파일을 참조해주시기 바랍니다.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Noto Sans KR&#39;, 맑은고딕, &#39;malgun gothic&#39;, AppleGothic, 돋움, dotum, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;□ 2025년 공공부문(일반정부+공기업) 수지(총수입-총지출)는 83.1조원 적자로 전년(69.1조원 적자)에 비해 적자폭이 14.0조원 확대&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Noto Sans KR&#39;, 맑은고딕, &#39;malgun gothic&#39;, AppleGothic, 돋움, dotum, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Noto Sans KR&#39;, 맑은고딕, &#39;malgun gothic&#39;, AppleGothic, 돋움, dotum, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; ㅇ 공공부문 총수입은 1,192.1조원으로 전년(1,139.1조원)에 비해 53.0조원(+4.7%) 증가&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Noto Sans KR&#39;, 맑은고딕, &#39;malgun gothic&#39;, AppleGothic, 돋움, dotum, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Noto Sans KR&#39;, 맑은고딕, &#39;malgun gothic&#39;, AppleGothic, 돋움, dotum, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; ㅇ 공공부문 총지출은 1,275.2조원으로 전년(1,208.1조원)보다 67.0조원(+5.5%) 증가&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;□ 2026년 상반기 중 우리나라의 지식서비스 무역수지는 64.4억달러 적자를 기록&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;□ 자세한 내용은 (붙임) 참조&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Noto Sans KR&#39;, 맑은고딕, &#39;malgun gothic&#39;, AppleGothic, 돋움, dotum, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;□ M2(광의통화, 계절조정계열, 평잔)는 전월대비 0.3% 증가&amp;nbsp; [원계열, 전년동월대비 +5.8%]&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Noto Sans KR&#39;, 맑은고딕, &#39;malgun gothic&#39;, AppleGothic, 돋움, dotum, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Noto Sans KR&#39;, 맑은고딕, &#39;malgun gothic&#39;, AppleGothic, 돋움, dotum, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;□ 자세한 내용은 &amp;lt;붙임&amp;gt; 참조&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;□ 한국은행(경제통계1국)은 한국통계학회와 공동으로 9월 11일(금)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;ldquo;AI, 데이터, 그리고 경제통계 : 변화하는 환경과 새로운 접근&amp;rdquo;을&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;주제로 포럼을 개최&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;o 강기훈 한국통계학회장의 개회사, 권민수 한국은행 부총재의&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;환영사에 이어 고려대 박민규 교수의 초청 강연, 주제발표 및&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;토론 순으로 진행&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;□ 이번 포럼에서는 AI&amp;middot;데이터 환경이 급속히 변하는 상황에서 미시&amp;middot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;거시 데이터간 불일치를 완화할 수 있는 통계적 방법론에 대해&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;논의하는 한편,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;AI Agent의 효과적이고 안전한 활용 및 분배 통계의 개선사항에&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;대한 연구 결과를 공유&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;o 발표자료 주요 내용은 &amp;lt;붙임&amp;gt; 참조&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Noto Sans KR&#39;, 맑은고딕, &#39;malgun gothic&#39;, AppleGothic, 돋움, dotum, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;;&quot;&gt;□ 2026년 2/4분기 외감기업의 성장성,&amp;nbsp;수익성, 안정성이 모두 개선&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;;&quot;&gt;ㅇ (성장성) 매출액증가율 : 26.1/4분기 13.5% &amp;rarr; 26.2/4분기 26.7%&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;총자산증가율 : 25.2/4분기 0.2% &amp;rarr; 26.2/4분기 6.8%&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;;&quot;&gt;ㅇ (수익성) 매출액영업이익률 : 25.2/4분기 5.1% &amp;rarr; 26.2/4분기 16.9%&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; 매출액세전순이익률 : 25.2/4분기 5.3% &amp;rarr;&amp;nbsp; 26.2/4분기 23.1%&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;;&quot;&gt;ㅇ (안정성) 부채비율 : 26.1/4분기 87.0% &amp;rarr; 26.2/4분기 84.5%&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;차입금의존도 : 26.1/4분기 23.9% &amp;rarr; 26.2/4분기 22.8%&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;;&quot;&gt;(자세한 내용은 붙임 참조)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;◈ 2026년 2/4분기 실질 국내총생산(GDP)은 전기대비 0.6% 성장,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; 전년동기대비 3.7% 성장&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;― 명목 GDP는 전기대비 9.2% 성장, 전년동기대비 26.4% 성장&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;◈ 실질 국민총소득(GNI)은 전기대비 3.1% 증가,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; 전년동기대비 15.6% 증가&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;― 명목 GNI는 전기대비 8.8% 증가, 전년동기대비 26.4% 증가&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;※ 자세한 내용은 첨부파일 참조&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p class=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 150%; margin-left: 26.4pt; text-indent: -26.4pt; word-break: keep-all; font-size: 3pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;; font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; line-height: 1.5; word-break: keep-all; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0pt; text-transform: none; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1.5; word-break: keep-all; text-indent: -27.6px;&quot;&gt;□&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;; font-size: 10pt; letter-spacing: -0.533333px;&quot;&gt;2026년 2/4분기말 예금취급기관의 산업별대출금 잔액은 2,065.3조원으로 전분기말 대비 30.6조원 증가하여 전분기(+30.8조원)에 비해 증가폭이 소폭 축﻿﻿﻿﻿﻿﻿소&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0px 35pt; line-height: 1.5; letter-spacing: -1px; word-break: keep-all; font-weight: 400; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &#39;Noto Sans KR&#39;, 맑은고딕, &#39;malgun gothic&#39;, AppleGothic, 돋움, dotum, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-indent: -35pt; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; line-height: 1.5; letter-spacing: -1px; word-break: keep-all; font-weight: bold; font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
