&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt; font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; 전년동기대비 3.6% 성장&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
