&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;□ 자세한 내용은 (붙임) 참조&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Noto Sans KR&#39;, 맑은고딕, &#39;malgun gothic&#39;, AppleGothic, 돋움, dotum, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;□ M2(광의통화, 평잔)는 전월대비 0.7% &amp;nbsp;[전년동월대비 +4.6%]&amp;nbsp; 증가&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Noto Sans KR&#39;, 맑은고딕, &#39;malgun gothic&#39;, AppleGothic, 돋움, dotum, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Noto Sans KR&#39;, 맑은고딕, &#39;malgun gothic&#39;, AppleGothic, 돋움, dotum, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;□ 자세한 내용은 &amp;lt;붙임&amp;gt; 참조&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;◈ 2025년 4/4분기 실질 국내총생산(GDP)은 전기대비 0.2% 감소, 전년동기대비 1.6% 증가&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; (명목 GDP는 전기대비 3.9%, 전년동기대비 +6.0%)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; ― 실질 국민총소득(GNI)은 전기대비 1.4% 증가, 전년동기대비 3.2% 증가&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; (명목 GNI는 전기대비 +4.0%, 전년동기대비 +5.8%)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;◈ 2025년 연간 실질 국내총생산(GDP)은 전년대비 1.0% 성장&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; (명목 GDP는 2,663.3조원으로 전년대비 +4.2%)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; ― 1인당 국민총소득(GNI)은 5,241.6만원으로 전년대비 4.6% 증가&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; (미 달러화 기준 36,855달러)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;※ 자세한 내용은 첨부파일 참조&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p class=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;margin-left: 20.7pt; text-indent: -20.7pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;□&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;2025&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;년 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;4/4&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;분기말 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;예금취급기관&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;의&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; vertical-align: super; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;산업별대출금 잔액&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;은 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;2,026.1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;조원&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;; letter-spacing: -0.4pt; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;으로&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;전분기말 대비 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;8.6&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;조원 증가&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;하였으며 전분기&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;(+20.2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;조원&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;에 비해 증가폭이 축소&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;margin-left: 35pt; text-indent: -35pt; word-break: keep-all; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;; font-size: 10pt; font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;margin-left: 35pt; text-indent: -35pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;ㅇ&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;산업별로는 제조업&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;(+1.2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;조원&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;서비스업&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;(+9.3&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;조원&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;용도별로는 운전자금&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;(+2.0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;조원&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;),&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;시설자금&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;(+6.6&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;조원&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;업권별로는 예금은행&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;(+9.6&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;조원&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;) &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;대출금이 증가&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Noto Sans KR&#39;, 맑은고딕, &#39;malgun gothic&#39;, AppleGothic, 돋움, dotum, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Noto Sans KR&#39;, 맑은고딕, &#39;malgun gothic&#39;, AppleGothic, 돋움, dotum, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;;&quot;&gt;□&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;;&quot;&gt;자세한 내용은&amp;nbsp;&amp;lt;붙임&amp;gt;&amp;nbsp;참조&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom: 12px; color: rgb(77, 77, 77); letter-spacing: -0.27px; font-family: &#39;Noto Sans KR&#39;, 맑은고딕, &#39;malgun gothic&#39;, AppleGothic, 돋움, dotum, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;□ 2026년 1월 경상수지는 132.6억달러 흑자를 기록&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom: 12px; color: rgb(77, 77, 77); letter-spacing: -0.27px; font-family: &#39;Noto Sans KR&#39;, 맑은고딕, &#39;malgun gothic&#39;, AppleGothic, 돋움, dotum, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom: 12px; color: rgb(77, 77, 77); letter-spacing: -0.27px; font-family: &#39;Noto Sans KR&#39;, 맑은고딕, &#39;malgun gothic&#39;, AppleGothic, 돋움, dotum, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;□ 자세한 내용은 (붙임) 참조&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Noto Sans KR&#39;, 맑은고딕, &#39;malgun gothic&#39;, AppleGothic, 돋움, dotum, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 13.3333px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;;&quot;&gt;□ 2026년 1월중 예금은행의 신규&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;;&quot;&gt;취급액 기준 저축성수신금리는 연 2.78%로 전월대비 0.12%p&amp;nbsp;하락하였으며, 대출금리는 연 4.24%로 전월대비 0.05%p&amp;nbsp;상승&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Noto Sans KR&#39;, 맑은고딕, &#39;malgun gothic&#39;, AppleGothic, 돋움, dotum, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 13.3333px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;― 2026년 1월말 잔액 기준&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;총수신금리는 연 2.01%로 전월말대비 0.01%p&amp;nbsp;상승하였으며, 총대출금리는 연 4.25%로 전월말대비 0.02%p 상승&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-family: &#39;Noto Sans KR&#39;, 맑은고딕, &#39;malgun gothic&#39;, AppleGothic, 돋움, dotum, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 13.3333px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;□&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;자세한&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;내용은&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;붙임&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;gt; 참조&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;□ 2026년 2월 기업심리지수는 제조업이 전월대비&amp;nbsp;0.4p&amp;nbsp;하락한 97.1을, 비제조업은 전월대비 0.5p&amp;nbsp;상승한 92.2을 기록&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;□ 2026년&amp;nbsp;2월 경제심리지수(ESI)는 전월에 비해&amp;nbsp;4.8p 상승한 98.8을 기록&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;※ 자세한 내용은 &amp;lt;첨부파일&amp;gt;을 참조하시기 바랍니다.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;소비자들&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: 돋움; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;의 경제상황에 대한 심리를 종합적으로 나타내는 소비자심리지수(CCSI)는&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 맑은고딕, &#39;malgun gothic&#39;, AppleGothic, 돋움, dotum, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt; font-family: 돋움;&quot;&gt;2월 중&amp;nbsp;112.1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt; font-family: 돋움;&quot;&gt;로 전월&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt; font-family: 돋움;&quot;&gt;대비 1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt; font-family: 돋움;&quot;&gt;.3&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt; font-family: 돋움;&quot;&gt;p 상승&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 맑은고딕, &#39;malgun gothic&#39;, AppleGothic, 돋움, dotum, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt; font-family: 돋움;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 13px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 맑은고딕, &#39;malgun gothic&#39;, AppleGothic, 돋움, dotum, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 11pt; font-family: 돋움;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;* 자세한 내용은 첨부파일을 참조해주시기 바랍니다.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 26.6667px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;;&quot;&gt;□ 2026년 1월 생산자물가지수는 전월대비 0.6% 상승(전년동월대비 1.9% 상승)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 26.6667px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; ○ 농림수산품 : 농산물(1.4%) 및 축산물(0.9%) 등이 올라 전월대비 0.7% 상승&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 26.6667px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;;&quot;&gt;○&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;;&quot;&gt;공산품 : 1차금속제품(3.0%), 컴퓨터&amp;middot;전자및광학기기(1.8%) 등이 올라&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;전월대비 0.6% 상승&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 26.6667px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;;&quot;&gt;○&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;;&quot;&gt;전력&amp;middot;가스&amp;middot;수도및폐기물 : 산업용도시가스(2.6%)가 올랐으나 폐기물수집운반&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;처리(-3.2%)가 내려 전월대비 보합&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 26.6667px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;;&quot;&gt;○&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;;&quot;&gt;서비스 : 금융및보험서비스(4.7%), 운송서비스(0.7%) 등이 올라 전월대비&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;0.7% 상승&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;*자세한 내용은 첨부파일을 참조하시길 바랍니다.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 13.3333px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;;&quot;&gt;□ 2025년 4/4분기말 가계신용 잔액은 1,978.8조원으로 전분기말 대비&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;;&quot;&gt;14.0조원 증가&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 13.3333px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;font-size: 13.3333px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;;&quot;&gt;o 가계대출 잔액은 1,852.7조원으로 전분기말 대비 11.1조원 증가,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;맑은 고딕&#39;;&quot;&gt;판매신용 잔액은 126.0조원으로 2.8조원 증가&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
